            "Notes": [
              "30MH G505E / G508E stations (U11, Br02069 p16): leaders 2-G505E (first station) and 2-G508E \u002B 2-G303E (SP. W/ G508E) over the rest of the first group; Fig. 5-397.501(B) marks that group \u00272 1/2\u0022 MIN. SPG. FOR SPLITTING REINF.\u0027 and G402E \u0027SPG. EXCEPT AS NOTED\u0027 - so G505E at the first, G508E at the other 4 stations of the 2 1/2\u0022 group, G402E from the next group on.",
